#! cask rack - casks in a cradle of watervine rope
#! Casks are stipple so they sit back, with solid body hoops and one lit stave
#! along the top of each - a barrel is read by its taper and its bands, and a
#! band drawn in highlight turns the cask into a stripe. The cradle stays plain.
